  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until it is lightly browned.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the basmati rice and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the water, salt, cardamom powder, and almond essence, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Fluff the rice with a fork and stir in the sliced almonds.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional sliced almonds if desired."
